hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"24286","Yazid narrated to us, Jarir ibn Hazim informed us, al-Zubayr ibn Sa'id al-Hashimi narrated to us, from Abdullah ibn Ali ibn Yazid ibn Rukanah, from his father, from his grandfather: That he divorced his wife irrevocably, and mentioned that to the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him). So he said: What did you intend by that? He said: One. He said: By Allah? He said: By Allah. He said: It is what you intended."
"24287","Ishaq ibn Isa narrated to us, from Jarir, with it."
